# Save everything as we go

`Custom Label Database/` docs plus parent `.cursor/rules/custom-label-database/` are the memory. A new chat will not remember this conversation. Write in the **same turn**.

| Kind | Where |
|------|--------|
| Policy / do-not / fill rule | Parent `.cursor/rules/custom-label-database/*.mdc` (one concern; globs for this app) |
| Role / hard do-nots | `Custom Label Database/AGENTS.md` |
| Facts, incidents, mappings | `docs/FINDINGS.md` |
| Current snapshot, leftovers | `docs/HANDOFF.md` |
| Live vs helper vs archive | `docs/WORKSPACE.md` |
| Chat transcript copy | `docs/chats/<uuid>.jsonl` |

Save: decisions, sources of truth, blank-only vs overwrite, CSV fills (counts, backup path, before→after), leftovers. If it mattered in chat, it belongs in a file.
